- This is the Next.js 15 project using React 19. 
- The project is using Tailwind CSS for styling. 
- The project is using Shadcn UI for components. Create components with Shadcn whenever possible
- When installing Shadcn use `npx shadcn@latest` command
- Its nextjs 15 project, so use the server components when possible and the new features of nextjs 15.
- Use server actions when possible.
- Use nextjs 15.